{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 已開始測試 macOS Golden Gate 的下一個更新，首個 macOS Golden Gate 27.3 Beta 現已向註冊開發者開放。該測試版在 macOS Golden Gate 27.2 推出後一週登場。</p>\n<h2>開發者測試版開放下載</h2>\n<p>註冊開發者可開啟「系統設定」應用程式，依次點選「一般」及「軟件更新」，並選擇加入 macOS Golden Gate Beta 測試，以下載 macOS Golden Gate 27.3。</p>\n<h2>Apple Intelligence 或擴至中國</h2>\n<p>另有傳聞指，Apple 可能隨 .3 版本更新把 Apple Intelligence 擴展至中國；至於新軟件還可能包含哪些其他內容，目前仍不清楚。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 macOS Golden Gate 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"448\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/macOS-Golden-Gate.webp\" width=\"800\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:41:24.732065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T18:20:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:24.049221+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T18:38:43.223977+00:00","content_hash":"9e73cc7b95ae047e839511725fb8b200e8c658b9d7ab96de6b009c6459fc39f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:41:24.732065+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}